  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The product contains all the non-3D printed parts for assembling an entirely functional New Vegas Light-Up Sign. To complete the work, you also need to download the model files and 3D print the remaining parts."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Creator Program: The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "To download the model files please visit the New Vegas Light-Up Sign on MakerWorld."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 24px; text-align: left;\">Overview</h2>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">The product contains all the <strong>non-3D printed</strong> parts for assembling an entirely functional <strong>New Vegas Light-Up Sign</strong>. To complete the work, you also need to download the <strong>model files</strong> and <strong>3D print</strong> the remaining parts.<span></span></p>\n<!--Overview部分（无需改动）-->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><em><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">Creator Program</span><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">:</span></em></strong></span><strong><em> </em></strong>The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs.</div>\n<!--创作者计划注释（无需改动）-->\n<p></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<p class=\"pct_p\">To download the model files please visit the <strong>New Vegas Light-Up Sign</strong> on <a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/2730611-new-vegas-light-up-sign?from=search#profileId-3026346\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">MakerWorld</span></strong></span></a>.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 24px; text-align: center;\">In The Box</h2>\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"height: 228px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 735.812px;\"><strong>Item</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 153.188px;\"><strong>Qty</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\"><!--行模块 增加行数复制整个<tr></tr>部分即可-->\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 735.812px;\"><span style=\"color: #2dc26b;\"><a href=\"../../products/battery-case?id=42122903814280\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #2dc26b;\" target=\"_blank\">AAA Battery Case with PH2.0 Connector (1PCS) - IA004</a></span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 153.188px;\">1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\"><!--行模块 增加行数复制整个<tr></tr>部分即可-->\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 735.812px;\"><span style=\"color: #2dc26b;\"><a href=\"../../products/black-nylon-cord?id=42731737219208\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #2dc26b;\" target=\"_blank\">0.6mm Black Nylon Cord 5m (1pcs) - MF001</a></span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 153.188px;\">1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\"><!--行模块 增加行数复制整个<tr></tr>部分即可-->\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 735.812px;\"><span style=\"color: #2dc26b;\"><a href=\"../../products/bt2-socket-head-cap-self-tapping-screws-shcs?id=42102711779464\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #2dc26b;\" target=\"_blank\">BT2x8 SHCS Self Tapping Screw (20PCS) - AA019</a></span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 153.188px;\">2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\"><!--行模块 增加行数复制整个<tr></tr>部分即可-->\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 735.812px;\"><span style=\"color: #2dc26b;\"><a href=\"../../products/sh1-0-to-dual-sh1-0-adapter-2pcs?id=616423030361321474\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #2dc26b;\" target=\"_blank\">SH1.0 to Dual SH1.0 Adapter (2PCS) </a></span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: 153.188px;\">2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19px;\"><!--行模块 增加行数复制整个<tr></tr>部分即可-->\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"height: 19px; width: